      "updated": 1742409069301,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "func getBooks (search,filter = desc, favorite_count){\n    - logica para pesquisar por:\n     titulo, sinopse ,autor, genero, editora\n  \n     -const skip = page && limit ? (page - 1) * limit : 0;\n\n    - orderBy{\n         orderBy: {orderBy: filter.orderBy},\n        where{where: filter.where}\n    }\n    - skip: skip,\n    - limit: limit\n\n        - return books[] \n}",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "func getBooks (search,filter = desc, favorite_count){\n    - logica para pesquisar por:\n     titulo, sinopse ,autor, genero, editora\n  \n     -const skip = page && limit ? (page - 1) * limit : 0;\n\n    - orderBy{\n         orderBy: {orderBy: filter.orderBy},\n        where{where: filter.where}\n    }\n    - skip: skip,\n    - limit: limit\n\n        - return books[] \n}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
